{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3d3093424304838f9491c55b8bc18e45ef37ccaca8179eac8e341d5bb8998d6f", "ja": "（『BATTLE OF THEATER』のドラマ企画が\n進んでいる。今日は、杏奈の衣装合わせだ）", "zh": "（『BATTLE OF THEATER』的电视剧企划正在推进中。今天是杏奈试装的日子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "a388ab937925060db6d2728facbbf9ed7c6cbf3189fe31596f836419dc65ccbd", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。\nえと……今、困ってること……ない……？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……\n那个……现在有没有什么……觉得为难的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "3710b2f6e01698e2294e23a6c52a077cffb4a09ea84c06645c4bc937305fb985", "ja": "ゲームで、倒せない相手……とか。\nクリアできない、クエスト、とか……。", "zh": "比如游戏里有没有打不过的对手……\n或者无法完成的任务……之类的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7fb3751e2436fbc7104e210e63271c066bb701d27cc93281b3e7fd066c02f3c5", "ja": "えっ。いや、特にないけど……\n急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？没什么特别的……\n怎么突然问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "bbdb3050ee114b826f8d123e45994b0d5089e7b6fec08888124be05dcd3adce8", "ja": "衣装……これは、ドラマの『杏奈』の、だから……\nいろいろ、練習……です。", "zh": "服装……这是剧里『杏奈』的，所以……\n在练习各种东西……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "58d996a555bccfec5e42352c82bdb02e938a1b5bcb5517467952648a1147f7ca", "ja": "杏奈は、{$P$}さんが大事……\n守りたい、です。", "zh": "对杏奈来说，{$P$}先生很重要……\n所以想要守护它……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c4dd409cd087d198a9db001d4baf9a60e92dd9d468dfacd089d5743caa6be609", "ja": "そうか、ありがとう！\nでも俺は、守ってもらわなくても大丈夫かな。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢！\n不过，就算不用你保护，我也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6a89a8d02cd05b9063bafa16b0dace638a24e4d65c620e9f2ab7726de1901d6b", "ja": "それに、レッスンを見ている限り、ちゃんと\nできてるように見えたけど……。何か悩んでるのか？", "zh": "而且，就我看你练习的情况来说，感觉你做得挺好的……是有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "85bcc8bc30f89b356a6928ba20d7eaab3b656acfbad35b3ed59a8d5c4a87eb4b", "ja": "ん……ちょっとだけ……。\n{$P$}さん、聞いても……いい？", "zh": "嗯……就一点点……\n{$P$}先生，我可以问你……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d47058fd1f633f9a941986e30230d865964c0fbca052500e7f4ff08deb318bbd", "ja": "もちろん。何でも話してくれ！", "zh": "当然。有什么话尽管说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "9a71a8287c3e731a1e1c21635dac439a82118c9faad98871c66535e769b9dc36", "ja": "ドラマの杏奈は、スイッチオフが、デフォ……。\nオンの杏奈を、操作して……ます。", "zh": "电视剧里的杏奈，默认就是关机状态……  \n正在操控，开启状态的杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "13e8ed4a81eaf4e177ee4a2c8af32b98e62a455790b1605a60b46338f99d1801", "ja": "百合子さんを、守りたいの……オンの杏奈と、\nオフの杏奈……どっちなのかな、って……。", "zh": "我想保护百合子……只是，我在想……到底是开启状态的杏奈，还是关闭状态的杏奈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a1ccc5a59c58ded06d545cadf4f29fe5e29222d25d8352b094dacd93cc79415d", "ja": "なるほど。改めてそう聞くと、\n確かにちょっと混乱しそうな設定かもな。", "zh": "原来如此。这样重新一问，\n确实是个让人有点混乱的设定呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1013_p", "source_sha256": "54c089918180f72365ee5e5d8beb5edd94666c98ba773a4c0cc0ad42dfbe7975", "ja": "でも……そこは、\nリアルと同じでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过……那部分，和现实一样不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "39d00cd4432629f2edd8b6c61235c71072cb22b8043bd55d373cf5fe86eba0cc", "ja": "……？\nリアルと……同じ……？", "zh": "……？\n和现实……一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9b1f156008f151a5c68e0d4f0dd11276200d3cc4dbfcfd383d20e04b68c010f4", "ja": "うん。ドラマは、視聴者にわかりやすいように、\n別の人格に見えるような描写があったりするけど……", "zh": "嗯。虽然电视剧为了让观众更容易理解，\n会有让人觉得像是不同人格的描写……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2f2ec7d65e548d530bd4f15091d600acba985182df5480897f009202a139714f", "ja": "現実だと、オフの杏奈とオンの杏奈は、どっちも\n同じ杏奈だからな。きっと、願いも同じなはずだ。", "zh": "现实里，私下的杏奈和台上的杏奈，无论哪个都是同一个杏奈。所以，她们的愿望肯定也是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "0af61a29f39403bb33b23b0d51c56864073bd917ac03fa4268a7f5bbbe01d64f", "ja": "……そう、だよね。両方の杏奈が、同じ気持ち……\nだから願いも、強くなる……。", "zh": "……是啊。线下的杏奈和线上的杏奈，都有着相同的心情……\n所以，愿望也会变得更强烈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0593_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "f0038a813b119355ccdc4a1ce4fce03eac57c91eba79afda376a9a7bd1526ce0", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}さん。\n杏奈、その気持ち……忘れないで、いるね。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生。\n杏奈……不会忘记这种心情的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
